its ‘maximum speed’, ‘minimum clean speed’, ‘minimum
speed’, or a specified speed. ‘Minimum clean speed’
signifies the minimum speed at which an aircraft can be
flown in a clean configuration, i.e. without deployment of
lift-augmentation devices, speed brakes or landing gear.
